[{"title":"留姜山怡云见访二绝并呈李磐庵文授 其一","author":"释宝昙","text":"怡云未至有人传，一笑伽梨落半肩。\n梦里亦知为此客，起来欢喜不成眠。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":13814,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"荷气","author":"释宝昙","text":"一池芳日上帘钩，荷气蒸人醉不收。\n藕欲作舟花作屋，更和风露管清秋。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":13815,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"婆饼焦","author":"释宝昙","text":"探得东君第一筹，略无风味笑鸣鸠。\n声声苦道焦婆饼，往往人传嫁橘洲。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":13816,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"弹琴","author":"释宝昙","text":"一鼓薰风至自南，再行新月堕瑶簪。\n高山流水人犹在，笛弄梅花莫再三。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":13817,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"曹娥庙","author":"释宝昙","text":"我初不作婆娑梦，子亦能知波险无。\n风卷潮来壮魂在，行人酾酒湿庭梧。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":13818,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"梅花","author":"释宝昙","text":"江南初见一枝春，陇月霜钟亦可人。\n不管玉堂岑寂夜，误随驿使马蹄尘。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":13819,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寒食","author":"释宝昙","text":"梨花吹雪渡清明，天亦那知倦客情。\n一院春寒无看处，黄鹂欲诉不成声。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":13820,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"答吴知府仲登见招三绝 其三","author":"释宝昙","text":"未暇云山圣处行，兹游已复慰平生。\n故林猿狖吾知识，木落霜枯也不争。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":13821,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"答吴知府仲登见招三绝 其一","author":"释宝昙","text":"一夜溪西唤客船，黎明十里走平川。\n尘泥未办湖山脚，更要长斋古佛前。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":13822,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"答吴知府仲登见招三绝 其二","author":"释宝昙","text":"渡水穿云已借书，蝇头一日五千馀。\n东家居士应怜我，白首那堪又徙居。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":13823,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"落帽","author":"释宝昙","text":"老去尘沙两鬓蓬，祇馀破帽裹西风。\n何人共醉黄花底，惊起翻鸦趁断鸿。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":13824,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"煎茶","author":"释宝昙","text":"午鼎松声万壑馀，蒲团曲几未全疏。\n春风肯入姜盐手，不废秋窗一夜书。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":13825,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"鼠狼二首 其二","author":"释宝昙","text":"谩自狼贪只鼠嗔，坏墙穿壁已无邻。\n儿童爱惜狸奴惯，生怪苍皇不近人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":13826,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"鼠狼二首 其一","author":"释宝昙","text":"业为鼠技不能群，酷似狼贪却畏人。\n歃血未乾犹窃粟，岂应秦了又生秦。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":13827,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"蜜蜂","author":"释宝昙","text":"两股花多上粉须，趁衙去计未全疏。\n蜜脾一点香先透，万斛醍醐总不如。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":13828,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题子陵钓台图三绝 其一","author":"释宝昙","text":"隐约江天汉客星，夜深曾傍紫微明。\n山川风物成迁变，犹有洪涛殷啸声。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":13829,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题平江范石湖桥壁二首 其二","author":"释宝昙","text":"天与湖光镜样平，道边野草亦知名。\n邻翁莫讶归来晚，未必山如锦瑟清。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":13830,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题平江范石湖桥壁二首 其一","author":"释宝昙","text":"经纶初不碍躬耕，更复缘诗太瘦生。\n莫问雪堂人在否，石湖依旧小桥横。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":13831,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题寿居仁远浦归帆","author":"释宝昙","text":"筑室江南欲尽头，故将沙尾系行舟。\n如何落日苍茫外，一幅西风去不收。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":13832,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题岘山图三绝 其二","author":"释宝昙","text":"湛辈而今岂有知，滔滔江汉定何时。\n无边落日丹枫外，有客来看堕泪碑。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":13833,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题岘山图三绝 其一","author":"释宝昙","text":"不见轻裘快马归，遥怜暮雨湿公衣。\n岘山十里城南路，灯火家家望翠微。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":13834,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题芜湖吉祥方丈小轩","author":"释宝昙","text":"低著疏篱宽著天，春风不撼楚江船。\n无人为挂屋头眼，明日清明花可怜。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":13835,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题喻弥陀接待院","author":"释宝昙","text":"作成宝钵梅花供，带得金池莲叶香。\n百亿万僧同一饱，弥陀接待胜诸方。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":13836,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"九日西湖","author":"释宝昙","text":"不须归梦更成都，九日西湖病已苏。\n试把黄花元自好，可怜白首不胜扶。\n谁边醉帽风攲侧，去底征鸿月有无。\n一夜抚心欣有得，后来人物不如吾。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":13837,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"十一月二十八日大雪有感","author":"释宝昙","text":"动地飞花变鹤林，天低直欲近墙阴。\n共知一饱明年事，谁识三号此日心。\n东望眼穿秦望白，西湖泪入镜湖深。\n无边真宰凄凉意，祇此凄凉直万金。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":13838,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"又和丐祠未报","author":"释宝昙","text":"黄金羁勒閟天闲，何似春山苜蓿间。\n白接䍦边馀瓮蚁，乌皮几外即尘阛。\n龙蛇大泽公真是，虎豹重门孰可攀。\n示不忘君还有道，卧听人语趁朝班。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":13839,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"又和归南湖喜成","author":"释宝昙","text":"吏退文书苦未醒，湖光靧面适全轻。\n风从北户来披拂，鹊傍南枝管送迎。\n许我杖藜来宿昔，观公诗律自前生。\n艺兰九畹辛夷百，续取离骚更老成。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":13840,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"又和自官舍梦归南湖","author":"释宝昙","text":"梦中身世亦间关，觉后悬知去不难。\n陶令归来犹有酒，子云老去不迁官。\n时供采撷花千树，醉共团栾竹万竿。\n想见春风更啼鸟，沉香庭院不胜寒。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":13841,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"又和病中遣怀","author":"释宝昙","text":"闻公多病正缘诗，酷似梅花太瘦时。\n故忆主人鸥去近，尚留宾客鹤归迟。\n把麾定复追苏子，鼓瑟无因见孺悲。\n已办扁舟轻似叶，明年真到习家池。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":13842,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"上刘左史二首 其二","author":"释宝昙","text":"不为穷愁始著书，一灯今与影同孤。\n从公亟欲问奇字，随世无因识故吾。\n赖有霜钟当北道，不应璧月自西湖。\n举头更觉天人近，环佩声中试一呼。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":13843,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"上刘左史二首 其一","author":"释宝昙","text":"邺下家声晚更高，南朝徐庾总儿曹。\n向来霖雨无双手，多在秋风一二毛。\n舌本旋浇甘露碗，词锋久淬鸊鹈膏。\n已知造物叮咛意，鸣鹤如今在九皋。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":13844,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"上明州高守喜雨","author":"释宝昙","text":"静倚炉薰听雨声，使君念虑在苍生。\n十分唤起群龙睡，千里如同一手耕。\n新绿沟塍鸣布谷，乱红庭院著流莺。\n禁林莫讶归来晚，待我丰年酒一行。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":13845,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"与侍讲程自靖州西归会于江陵二首 其二","author":"释宝昙","text":"古天下士亦多艰，魑魅于今合改颜。\n道在盖公犹梦见，天怜贾谊得生还。\n风休江北一声橹，春尽剑南何处山。\n故国异方身健在，也知书眠未斓斑。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":13846,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"与侍讲程自靖州西归会于江陵二首 其一","author":"释宝昙","text":"不以中书老见疏，斯文成就合穷居。\n退之彻在南阳后，子美贫于天宝初。\n绛帐归来宾客在，玉堂有此丈人欤。\n片帆我已东南去，会见含香近紫虚。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":13847,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"子规","author":"释宝昙","text":"荏苒春三月，声声何处寻。\n艰难悲故国，激烈动归心。\n血染红英乱，身藏绿树深。\n欲归归未得，故故傍人吟。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":13848,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"为王公明枢密寿","author":"释宝昙","text":"老子当年此日生，麒麟元在地中行。\n岂惟谔谔人争忌，亦对堂堂目屡惊。\n持国尚卑千斛力，总戎曾作万夫城。\n经纶不似书痴绝，堪与君王造太平。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":13849,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"为王师宣子寿 其一","author":"释宝昙","text":"风入床琴帝梦阑，蓬莱为辍老仙官。\n袖曾有缚于菟手，头不须簪獬豸冠。\n桃李无言民自乐，冰霜折指吏应寒。\n西京人物如南渡，更躐三王一等看。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":13850,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"为王师宣子寿 其二","author":"释宝昙","text":"已办香山铁石心，未妨富贵日侵寻。\n荔枝黄压腰围重，琥珀红添盏晕深。\n鸾镜黛眉无此画，雁行银甲有馀音。\n剩呼歌舞为君寿，道眼何曾外物侵。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":13851,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"为王漕寿","author":"释宝昙","text":"十日西风便老成，挽回金气愈高明。\n朱轓玉节非吾事，雪竹霜松不世情。\n未可买山归卜筑，却须持橐慰平生。\n如公骨相应仙去，绿发朱颜已有名。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":13852,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"为陈天与大监寿","author":"释宝昙","text":"太史笔端云似画，老人星外月如规。\n十分酷似梅花瘦，一点非关玉琯吹。\n谏草成山安用许，槐庭转日未应迟。\n东风快便公须醉，莫问人间是几时。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":13853,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"王大卿挽词三首 其三","author":"释宝昙","text":"出处诚吾事，园林正及时。\n乾坤身老大，兄弟日追随。\n生死真谭笑，过逢类别离。\n小楼今夜月，照我泪双垂。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":13854,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"王大卿挽词三首 其二","author":"释宝昙","text":"少日佳公子，中年古吏师。\n霜严公事毕，韵胜客杯迟。\n诗律曹刘上，心期籍湜知。\n用公浑不尽，一世有馀悲。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":13855,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"王大卿挽词三首 其一","author":"释宝昙","text":"白璧连城重，黄金百鍊刚。\n固应须润色，肯为世低昂。\n议论倾馀子，声名彻上方。\n冯唐元未老，归计已苞桑。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":13856,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"古城兰若有竹数百道人筑墙而疏逖之十有九居于外或以净香名之取少陵雨洗娟娟净之语殆少吾此君也故以此意为出一语赠之","author":"释宝昙","text":"岂无四海老兄弟，恐堕春风年少名。\n晴檐甫见天目面，夜雨共传笙筑声。\n淋漓素壁江国在，参错拂衣花鸟惊。\n汝亦群龙护持一，此中七字有坚城。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":13857,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"古梅","author":"释宝昙","text":"却尽铅华固自奇，更怜鬓发傲霜姿。\n百年可敬春风面，四老仍扶汉惠时。\n顾影不知身妩媚，嗅香全觉我支离。\n殷勤为注铜瓶水，青子累累定著枝。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":13858,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"史魏公寿","author":"释宝昙","text":"西风九日又黄花，瑞霭朝来入相家。\n四海几人深雨露，一身随处老烟霞。\n拈花宗旨依黄檗，鍊石工夫笑女娲。\n再拜愿公千岁寿，莫辞沉醉是生涯。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":13859,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"用前韵寄吴知府","author":"释宝昙","text":"知有堂堂在故山，忘机未许白鸥闲。\n洗心羲易窥三圣，盥手楞严辩八还。\n剩著林花供笑粲，唤回春梦付绵蛮。\n闻公已是诗成集，一字千金岂易删。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":13860,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"用前韵寄吴知府广德归","author":"释宝昙","text":"好风吹梦到祠山，造物乾忙我自闲。\n五日颂声今故在，一春诗债共谁还。\n鼠肝虫臂窥前辈，蜗角蝇头战百蛮。\n遥指行云为公说，由来此语不须删。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":13861,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"用前韵谢吴知府","author":"释宝昙","text":"闻道江南庾子山，新诗脱手意长闲。\n未尝临镜嗟迟暮，更约何人共往还。\n我有茅茨依橘柚，自怜风雨窜荆蛮。\n悲欢怨怼三千首，乞与无思为一删。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":13862,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"龙孙","author":"释宝昙","text":"自是龙孙贵，时方燕乳云。\n锦绷无浣濯，玉立有仍云。\n未解吟风雨，应须赦斧斤。\n渭川十万甲，留以壮吾军。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":13863,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"再韵谢晁郎中二首 其二","author":"释宝昙","text":"故著文书尽底围，要看江汉濯秋晖。\n眼明自可穷诸妄，语妙何妨为一挥。\n今日西州成故里，它年东阁许同归。\n胸中衮衮平生事，身瘦缘渠不得肥。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":13864,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"再韵谢晁郎中二首 其一","author":"释宝昙","text":"病见春山四打围，茅檐华发只晖晖。\n不愁书册无人语，强把杉枝为客挥。\n意在未妨身更远，林疏自是月先归。\n百年人物如公少，试问何缘道则肥。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":13865,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"再韵谢提举苏道山","author":"释宝昙","text":"手种梧桐一百围，天生鸾凤翳朝晖。\n西南人物惟公在，汝颍风流祇涕挥。\n纵有诗筒怜苦李，岂无药裹要当归。\n黑头未用黄金印，且与斯民共瘠肥。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":13866,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次杨绵州韵二首 其二","author":"释宝昙","text":"我自吴头楚尾来，射工一见故相猜。\n文书已作牛腰束，阊阖仍须燕尾开。\n江近危楼才咫尺，眼悬落日殆千回。\n名成莫讶归来早，要学峨嵋翠作堆。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":13867,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次杨绵州韵二首 其一","author":"释宝昙","text":"夜潮明日浙东西，故国征鸿各自归。\n白璧一双唯我在，行年六十似公希。\n人生自是专城贵，道眼何曾与世违。\n剩种春风付桃李，等闲人共惜芳菲。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":13868,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵李太博书羽扇亭二首 其一","author":"释宝昙","text":"不许屏间著妓围，却容半坐对斜晖。\n官馀战马浑无用，雨扼边云故一挥。\n诗入邛崃应更险，身如杜宇肯忘归。\n殷勤沥酒苍波外，罢点驼酥斫蟹肥。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":13869,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵李太博书羽扇亭二首 其二","author":"释宝昙","text":"艰难当不减腰围，过尽瞿塘几夕晖。\n万里江山劳疾置，一番书札枉亲挥。\n尘埃好却西风扇，行李仍从北道归。\n底处最关天下事，秋来马不龁民肥。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":13870,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵施伯才除夕","author":"释宝昙","text":"年来白发为谁新，恰受愁边五日春。\n官烛吹花方作梦，东风卷地已无人。\n今年有酒公须醉，明日无襦子莫嗔。\n香案已催朝玉帝，何如剪纸奏钱神。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":13871,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"江阁","author":"释宝昙","text":"山影随人尽，江流入地深。\n乾坤孤客泪，桃李一生心。\n落日牛羊渚，春风桑柘林。\n周南留滞意，聊试小棠阴。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":13872,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"百舌","author":"释宝昙","text":"声声何处学，得得为春来。\n花底犹亲切，人怜巧剪裁。\n不容身稳密，且为月徘徊。\n赖有黄鹂伴，殷勤唤得回。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":13873,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"过曹娥江","author":"释宝昙","text":"钱塘雪浪与天平，小入曹娥亦有声。\n沧海一时忠孝泪，夕阳无尽古今情。\n春秋祭血神如在，一夜行舟挽到明。\n不是西风白云客，祠乌争解赋将迎。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":13874,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"别杨道夫二首 其二","author":"释宝昙","text":"小上鱼舟去，悬忧雁足疏。\n我方锄剩语，公亦喜成书。\n絮帽风惊折，绨袍意有馀。\n孤云日边路，时与问何如。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":13875,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"别杨道夫二首 其一","author":"释宝昙","text":"当道纷豺虎，逢人说象龙。\n一时馀砥柱，何处见霜钟。\n诸子方嗤点，吾行未缺供。\n大方同一笑，鹏鴳各舂容。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":13876,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"吴知府挽诗三首 其三","author":"释宝昙","text":"千里频年别，人来数寄书。\n旧题红叶处，犹记白头初。\n薤露危如此，庭兰赋有馀。\n摩挲东望眼，归泣向吾庐。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":13877,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"吴知府挽诗三首 其二","author":"释宝昙","text":"小试牛刀在，长驱马足迟。\n此生空抱负，真宰孰维持。\n道并湖山重，民深雨露思。\n何当十围腹，重作北窗期。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":13878,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"吴知府挽诗三首 其一","author":"释宝昙","text":"妙年声落落，晚岁陈堂堂。\n政出诸公右，吾宁一老傍。\n园林春婉娩，坟土泪凄凉。\n孝友无馀事，新诗入锦囊。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":13879,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"呈胡舍人二首 其二","author":"释宝昙","text":"官闲无事只深禅，斋戒何曾废客烟。\n总是老夫贪佛日，未妨天眼识公年。\n江湖满意藏诗笥，鸥鸟无心傍客船。\n参井黄昏云雾里，光明犹有一灯传。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":13880,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"呈胡舍人二首 其一","author":"释宝昙","text":"东观何如双树家，丝絇归践故园沙。\n静知水镜中人物，香识炉烟上鬓华。\n尽有春风飞燕子，岂无诗兴到梅花。\n自怜老子归来晚，不得追随八月槎。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":13881,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"杨郡王挽词二首 其二","author":"释宝昙","text":"乞得身闲日，仍烦卧护归。\n将军三尺箠，天子一戎衣。\n生死真谈笑，功名愈发挥。\n西风卷丹旐，人泪湿斜晖。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":13882,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}}]